  <div class="note">
    <strong>Fact-Checked Notes for Students:</strong><br>
    1. <strong>Why do some websites show ₹1.2 Lakh – ₹4 Lakh fees?</strong> That figure includes 4 years of optional hostel & mess charges (~₹38,000/year for mess) or the maximum ₹4 Lakh limit of the Bihar Student Credit Card (BSCC) scheme. Actual college + BEU exam fees total under ₹45,000 for 4 years.<br>
    2. <strong>Scholarships:</strong> SC/ST/BC/EBC students receive ₹14,000–₹15,000/year under the Bihar Post Matric Scholarship (PMS), which effectively covers almost the entire academic fee.<br>
    3. <strong>How Placements Work in Newer GECs:</strong> Colleges established in 2019–2020 participate in centralized placement pool drives organized by Bihar Engineering University (BEU) in Patna, where IT service firms (TCS, Wipro, Infosys, HCL, Accenture, QSpiders) hire across colleges at ₹3.0–₹3.6 LPA.
